# Build output
build/
build-rel/
build-x86/

# Third-party icon packages, fetched by design/fetch-icons.ps1.
#
# Deliberately NOT committed. Only Lucide's outlines ship, and they ship as
# generated path data in src/icon_data.inc with the licence in
# THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt. Committing the packages themselves would mean
# redistributing three whole icon sets we do not use, which is a licence
# obligation taken on for nothing. Run the fetch script to regenerate.
design/icon-sets/

# Crops of the running window, regenerated by design/grab-current-icons.ps1
design/icon-candidates/

# Generated design artefacts, excluded for the same reason as the icon packages:
# they carry other people's work that the product does not ship.
#
#   bench.dist.html    embeds twelve OFL font subsets. Redistributing them is a
#                      licence obligation (notice + full OFL text alongside) for
#                      a bench that is not the product. Rebuild: design/build.ps1
#   icon-compare.html  carries path data from four icon sets, three of which the
#                      product does not use. Rebuild:
#                      design/build-icon-compare.ps1, after fetch-icons.ps1
design/bench.dist.html
design/icon-compare.html

# Screenshots and scratch folders written by the verify-*.ps1 harnesses
artifacts/

# Runtime
*.log
oriel-shim.off
